xttravel.com/cities/paris/tours/montmartre-neighborhood-tour","https://montmartrefootsteps.com/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Seine river cruise after dark","type":"activity","detail":"Glide past lit monuments from Pont Neuf and catch the Eiffel Tower sparkle on the hour; basic boats from about 25 euros, dinner boats upscale.","link":"https://www.getyourguide.com/seine-river-l2601/night-tours-tc10/","evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":25,"urls":["https://www.getyourguide.com/seine-river-l2601/night-tours-tc10/","https://www.vedettesdupontneuf.com/cruises/","https://www.parisinsidersguide.com/paris-dinner-cruises.html","https://www.timeout.com/paris/en/attractions/paris-river-cruises"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Eiffel Tower at night","type":"activity","detail":"See the tower shimmer with thousands of bulbs after sunset; the Trocadero terraces and nearby lawns give the classic full frame view.","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":25,"urls":["https://www.travelcaffeine.com/best-attractions-paris-france/","https://www.bloggeratlarge.com/the-best-things-to-do-in-paris/","https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g187147-Activities-Paris_Ile_de_France.html","https://www.hudsonandemily.com/paris/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Eat like a local: markets and wine bars","type":"experience","detail":"Graze a covered market such as Beauvau, then squeeze into a standing wine bar for cold cuts; Belleville and the Marais are the food streets.","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":25,"urls":["https://www.heatheronhertravels.com/blogger-food-tips-paris/","https://www.cityunscripted.com/travel-magazine/paris-what-to-eat","https://maddysavenue.com/where-to-eat-in-paris/","https://www.eatwith.com/l/destinations/paris"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Louvre masterpieces morning","type":"activity","detail":"One of the world's great museums, from the Mona Lisa to the Venus de Milo; go early and pick two or three wings rather than everything.","e